sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant Server as AutoGluon Server Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant ModelServer as KServe ModelServer<br/>(in-process FastAPI)
    participant Detected as AutoGluonDetectedModel<br/>(in-process)
    participant Predictor as TabularPredictor /<br/>TimeSeriesPredictor<br/>(in-process)
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: Model Loading at Startup

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Server: Init Container Phase
        Storage-->>Server: KServe Storage Initializer downloads<br/>model artifacts to /mnt/models<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Cloud IAM
        Server->>Server: runtime_paths: ensure writable<br/>dirs for AutoGluon + matplotlib
        Server->>Detected: Auto-detect model type
        Detected->>Detected: predictor_detect:<br/>try TimeSeriesPredictor first
        alt Time Series Model
            Detected->>Predictor: Load as TimeSeriesPredictor
        else Tabular Model
            Detected->>Predictor: Fallback to TabularPredictor
        end
        Note right of Detected: version_compat: allows<br/>patch-level mismatches
    end

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: Inference Request (v1 Protocol)

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Gateway->>Server: Forward request<br/>mTLS (service mesh)
        Server->>ModelServer: FastAPI routes request
        ModelServer->>Detected: predict(request)
        Detected->>Predictor: delegate to loaded predictor
        alt Tabular Model
            Predictor->>Predictor: DataFrame predict()<br/>or predict_proba()
        else Time Series Model
            Predictor->>Predictor: TimeSeriesPredictor.predict()<br/>with optional known_covariates
        end
        Predictor-->>Detected: Prediction result
        Detected-->>ModelServer: JSON response
        ModelServer-->>Server: HTTP 200
        Server-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Prediction
    end

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: Inference Request (v2 Protocol - Tabular Only)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models/{model}/infer<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        Gateway->>Server: Forward request<br/>mTLS (service mesh)
        Server->>ModelServer: FastAPI routes request
        ModelServer->>Detected: predict(request, v2 format)
        Detected->>Predictor: TabularPredictor only
        Predictor->>Predictor: Per-feature tensor decode<br/>→ DataFrame → predict()
        Predictor-->>Detected: Tensor response
        Detected-->>ModelServer: v2 InferResponse
        ModelServer-->>Server: HTTP 200
        Server-->>Gateway: Response
        Gateway-->>Client: Tensor Prediction
    end
